From 024a4cf6fa78a8857fc6703a44958362cd1d416d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: John Rinehart <johnrichardrinehart@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 21:47:56 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] input: support per-device keyboard settings

One seat-wide keyboard configuration forces identical XKB settings on
all physical keyboards. This prevents a host-native laptop layout from
working with firmware-native external keyboards.

Accept named keyboard sections and merge matching settings over the
default. Switch the seat keymap when the active input device changes.
Cache libinput resolutions and clear them on removal or config reload.
